00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:07,520
Ida and Enid's brainchild became the first

243
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:10,420
to be called a maiden form.

244
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:12,720
And the company has been synonymous with the bra ever

245
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:13,660
