246
00:19:13,661 --> 00:19:24,840
Maidenform engineers were the pioneers of individual cup size and the adjustable strap.

247
00:19:24,841 --> 00:19:28,640
And with the help of models to size their products, they continue to be on the cutting

248
00:19:28,641 --> 00:19:29,640
