249
00:19:29,641 --> 00:19:35,840
I come into the office, I take off my clothes, and I put bras and panties on.

250
00:19:35,841 --> 00:19:41,000
To make the smoothest, most integrated product possible, Maidenform uses ultrasonic fusion

251
00:19:41,001 --> 00:19:43,489
technology to attach its materials.

252
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:47,400
You can't hear it, but high frequency sound waves alone

253
00:19:47,401 --> 00:19:49,126
