254
00:19:49,127 --> 00:19:53,640
When we take the inner and outer materials such here and with a foam

255
00:19:53,641 --> 00:19:59,400
lining and you hit them with a very, very high pitched noise, it actually seals up the edge and

256
00:19:59,401 --> 00:20:01,017
you can do it with a decorative edge.

257
00:20:01,018 --> 00:20:03,640
The benefit is that you get the smoothest transition between

258
00:20:03,641 --> 00:20:04,449
