259
00:20:04,450 --> 00:20:09,240
The biggest challenge in women's intimate apparel has always been forming the

260
00:20:09,241 --> 00:20:12,480
the bra's cups to fit an individual woman's figure.

261
00:20:12,481 --> 00:20:14,340
A woman's bust is three-dimensional,

262
00:20:14,341 --> 00:20:16,340
and fabrics are two-dimensional.

263
00:20:16,341 --> 00:20:18,300
So whether you're sewing them here,

264
00:20:18,301 --> 00:20:21,660
or you're fusing them together, or molding them,

265
00:20:21,661 --> 00:20:24,340
you're always trying to change the characteristic

266
00:20:24,341 --> 00:20:27,320
of a two-dimensional material into a three-dimensional

267
00:20:27,321 --> 00:20:29,980
material.

268
00:20:29,981 --> 00:20:33,860
Maidenform's design lab features precision equipment

269
00:20:33,861 --> 00:20:36,140
that can make a bra cup with pinpoint accuracy.

270
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:50,720
With the appropriate pressure, temperature, and time, the cups emerge, precisely formed

271
00:20:50,721 --> 00:20:59,680
