274
00:21:11,972 --> 00:21:13,880
In 1943, eccentric

275
00:21:13,881 --> 00:21:19,560
billionaire Howard Hughes went beyond that to create the world's first steel underwire push-up

276
00:21:19,561 --> 00:21:25,887
bra for the amply endowed Jane Russell, the star of his film The Outlaw.

277
00:21:25,888 --> 00:21:27,820
Bras went through many

278
00:21:27,821 --> 00:21:32,560
incarnations in the 20th century. From the cross your heart for lift and separation.

279
00:21:32,561 --> 00:21:36,560
Cross your heart, see? You're suddenly shapelier.

