00:22:06,601 --> 00:22:09,600
with the sensors built right in.

288
00:22:09,601 --> 00:22:12,480
The sensors in the band circling the rib cage

289
00:22:12,481 --> 00:22:14,780
pick up the body's electrical impulses,

290
00:22:14,781 --> 00:22:16,920
then transmit the data to a digital readout

291
00:22:16,921 --> 00:22:19,420
on a watch or treadmill.

292
00:22:19,421 --> 00:22:20,720
Traditionally, heart rate was taken

293
00:22:20,721 --> 00:22:22,980
by placing two fingers on an artery.

294
00:22:22,981 --> 00:22:24,720
This was really difficult considering the fact

295
00:22:24,721 --> 00:22:28,720
that now had to count and do math and probably stop working out,

296
00:22:28,820 --> 00:22:30,920
which obviously defeated the whole purpose

297
00:22:31,020 --> 00:22:32,420
of taking a heart rate.

298
00:22:32,520 --> 00:22:34,220
You're going to get a better monitor,

299
00:22:34,320 --> 00:22:35,760
better feeding, everything.

300
00:22:35,860 --> 00:22:37,160
So it's awesome.

301
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:38,660
Love it.

