00:28:13,241 --> 00:28:18,240
It's good for anybody who's near flash flames, and that could be people who are out in the cold,

395
00:28:18,241 --> 00:28:21,240
and people in the military, mainly.

396
00:28:21,241 --> 00:28:23,240
Back out! Back out!

