00:29:25,081 --> 00:29:32,080
To keep them warm and dry, Americans purchase nearly 4 billion pairs of socks every year.

410
00:29:32,081 --> 00:29:40,080
And with new strides being made in the sock-making trade, we can now take a step in the right direction with renewed confidence.

411
00:29:40,081 --> 00:29:44,080
When I was in high school, you had basically two kinds of socks.

