00:31:21,520 --> 00:31:25,200
And this machine basically picks up socks in an automated

435
00:31:25,300 --> 00:31:28,840
way, actually orients it inside the machine, and then

436
00:31:28,940 --> 00:31:32,540
automatically closes the toe, and then deposits the sock on

437
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:34,400
the other side of the machine.

438
00:31:34,500 --> 00:31:38,280
So it's able to go in, identify what the sock layout is, flip

439
00:31:38,380 --> 00:31:42,840
it around, turn it, change it, get it oriented, and at the

440
00:31:42,841 --> 00:31:46,180
And at the very end of the process, it'll close that toe.

441
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:53,020
With the toe seams in place, the socks are ready for bleaching.

442
00:31:54,460 --> 00:31:57,620
This tub will hold 600 pounds of socks.

