00:32:07,740 --> 00:32:11,080
After bleaching, a conveyor belt loads the socks into dryers.

446
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:16,840
And oddly enough, not one is ever lost.

447
00:32:16,841 --> 00:32:22,020
I wish I knew what happened to our socks in the dryer at home, but I can't seem to come

448
00:32:22,021 --> 00:32:24,020
